\par
A Windows workspace for MikroTik network management and synchronized business data.\par
Qt 6 / QML interface, C++20 engine. Arabic RTL and English.\par
\par
This edition supports FG Server login, scoped business browsing and CSV export,\par
RADIUS users/sessions, server diagnostics, RouterOS 7 REST reads and a floating read terminal.\par
Passwords and login sessions are not saved. Trusted HTTPS is required.\par
\par
Android parity is still in progress: voucher creation/printing, financial edits,\par
HotSpot setup, portal deployment, router writes and RouterOS 6 API are not included yet.\par
\par
Use a separate Windows account in the same tenant and branch to avoid revoking\par
sessions on your phone or web panel. This installer does not modify your routers.\par
